n+= adds 1 to the value n, when removing it, the while loop continues on forever and prints the message an infinite amount of times
print("Type in a message, and I'll display it ten times.")

message = input("Message: ")
print()

n = 0
while n < 10:
    print(f"{n + 1}. {message}")
    n += 1

